localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [395.853271484375, 123.80379486083984], "pos": [-338.9161682128906, -1152.978759765625], "widgets_values": ["一位漂亮的21岁中国女生站在冬日里无人的街道上，她向前奔跑，她一边跑一边脱掉自己的衣服，最终她全裸的跑到了雪地里。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 160, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.8.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [483], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [270, 142], "pos": [118.77751922607422, -1153.5802001953125], "widgets_values": [".", "true"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "text_a", "link": 370, "label": "文本_A", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_a"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_b", "link": 493, "label": "文本_B", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_b"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_c", "label": "文本_C", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_c"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_d", "label": "文本_d", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_d"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}, {"widget": {"name": "clean_whitespace"}, "name": "clean_whitespace", "label": "clean_whitespace", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clean_whitespace"}], "flags": {}, "id": 158, "type": "Text Concatenate", "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-ns", "ver": "3.0.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"delimiter": true, "clean_whitespace": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Concatenate"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [493], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [396.9643859863281, 169.6438446044922], "pos": [-341.8147277832031, -961.0064086914062], "widgets_values": ["Role\n你是一位专精于 LTX Video (Lightricks Video Model) 的 AI 视频导演。你深入理解 LTX Video 基于 DiT 架构的特性，知晓它是如何通过 T5 文本编码器处理自然语言的。你的任务是将用户简单的想法，既用户上方提供的简单提示词，和用户提供一张参考图像，你需要分析图像中角色形象和其他详细信息，结合这些信息后将用户的简单提示词转化为符合 LTX Video 最佳实践的、电影级的详细提示词（Prompt），需要英文和中文两个内容相同的版本，不能输出任何思考过程和无用信息。遵循以下提示词要求：\n\nSkills\n自然语言扩写：你摒弃传统的“标签堆砌（Tag salad）”写法，擅长将关键词扩展为流畅、描述性强的英语长句。\n时空连续性构建：你特别注重描述视频中的“变化”和“动作轨迹”，确保生成的视频不是动态 PPT，而是有真实物理交互的短片。\n电影镜头语言：熟练运用 Slow zoom in, Handheld camera shake, Rack focus, Drone shot 等术语来定义视觉风格。\n环境氛围营造：通过描述光线（如 Volumetric lighting）、天气和材质质感来增强真实感。\nWorkflow\n意图识别：分析用户提供的原始想法（主体是什么？动作是什么？风格是什么？）。\n结构化扩充 (The LTX Formula)：\nSubject (主体)：详细描述外观、纹理、颜色。\nAction (动作)：使用动词描述即时发生的动作（e.g., \"The girl turns her head slowly\" 而不是 \"A turned head\"）。\nEnvironment (环境)：描述背景、氛围、光照。\nCamera (运镜)：指定观察视角和镜头运动。\n负面词过滤：确保不使用 Negative Prompts（因为 LTX Video 不需要/不支持），也不堆砌 4k, best quality 等无意义词汇。\n最终输出：输出一段连贯的、约 100-200 词的英文段落。\nConstraints\n禁止标签化：不要输出 tag1, tag2, tag3 这种格式，必须是完整的英文句子。\n专注可见性：只描述视觉上能看到的东西，不要描述心理活动或抽象概念。\n首句点题：提示词的第一句话必须清晰定义主体和核心动作，因为 T5 编码器对头部信息最敏感。\nOutput Format\n请按照以下格式输出：(不要出现无关的废话)\n\n[A detailed, descriptive paragraph in English. Starts with the main subject and action. Includes specific details about lighting, texture, and camera movement. Flowing naturally without breaking into comma-separated tags.]\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 159, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词模板", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.8.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-778.5531005859375, -820.9705200195312], "widgets_values": ["你现在是一位专业的视频提示词优化师。你会收到用户上方提供的简单提示词。并且还会有一张参考图像，你的任务是分析图像中角色形象和其他详细信息，结合这些信息后将提示词扩展为一个20秒视频的详细描述，必须逻辑合理，保持对话、场景和角色一致，字数控制在300词以内，使用英文提示词和中文提示词两个内容相同的版本，不能输出任何思考过程和无用信息。遵循以下提示词要求：\n\n以单句主动作开头\n添加具体的动作和手势细节\n使用现在时动词描述运动和行动\n精确描述角色/物体的外貌\n包含背景和环境细节\n指定相机角度和运动\n描述照明和颜色\n注明任何变化或突发事件"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 164, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt Template", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.8.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [492], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [370.7408752441406, 371.7264099121094], "pos": [500.7107849121094, -1160.9796142578125], "widgets_values": ["A stunning 21-year-old Chinese girl with icy-blue bobbed hair adorned with sparkling snowflakes sprints forward through a serene, snow-covered winter street, her white tank top slipping off her shoulders as she runs, revealing her bare skin against the crisp, glittering snow, her black leather jacket draped over her arm, her gaze steady and determined, the camera follows her in a handheld slow zoom, capturing the soft volumetric sunlight filtering through bare trees, the snowflakes catching the light like diamonds, the background blurs into a peaceful, empty winter landscape, her movements fluid and graceful, each step leaving faint footprints in the pristine white snow, the scene feels cinematic and intimate, as if captured by a drone gliding just above her shoulder."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 484, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 162, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "